# wlink directives for WIN87EM.DLL (win87em/). Object files and the output
# name come from the Makefile. Ordinals 1-5 as observed on Windows 3.1
# (docs/exports/WIN87EM.txt). UNVERIFIED: ordinal 2 has no name there;
# WEP (ordinal 6, needed to take the emulator off its vectors when the DLL
# is freed) was not among the observed ordinals.
format windows dll
option modname=WIN87EM
option description 'w16 WIN87EM'
option start=libentry
option quiet
option map
segment type code fixed preload
segment type data fixed preload
export __FPMATH.1 resident
export WIN87EM_2.2
export __WIN87EMINFO.3 resident
export __WIN87EMRESTORE.4 resident
export __WIN87EMSAVE.5 resident
export WEP.6 resident
import GETWINFLAGS KERNEL.132
import GLOBALALLOC KERNEL.15
import GLOBALFREE KERNEL.17
